SOAPBOX: We're VERY lucky to enjoy something like the WW-CW in our ham radio "careers" ...
SOAPBOX: For a SOABLP entry with limited antennas, this one is quite an enduro !
SOAPBOX: Congratulations and thanks to the stations hearing me on 40m ... I used a Hustler antenna, on the back of my pickup truck, in the driveway, fed with 100 feet of RG-58.
SOAPBOX: My yagi ( 3 el tribander ) A3 at 25' over the roof of the house put a lot of DX in the log this weekend.
SOAPBOX: 73/OJ - Frank ( K4EJ )
